{"4475550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Unfinished Melody: Prologue", "steam_appid": 4475550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the lost melody, the feelings left unspoken, and the most precious memories buried deep within the heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a fantastical and mysterious world, where light and shadow intertwine. Keep moving forward through this dreamlike realm and embark on an unforgettable journey of wonder and adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/a2f12ca8702b136385bbc3ad378d245b.avif?t=1787751809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras_big/a2f12ca8702b136385bbc3ad378d245b.avif?t=1787751809 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Party Leader System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different characters as your party leader when talking to NPCs to trigger unique dialogue and story events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/c856e3328281e0de2cb5304aafc30028.avif?t=1787751809\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras_big/c856e3328281e0de2cb5304aafc30028.avif?t=1787751809 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friendship Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give gifts to your favorite capybara friends! Raise your friendship level to unlock special CG illustrations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Side-Scrolling Stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In addition to traditional map exploration, the game also features brand-new side-scrolling stages, offering different interactions and a fresh gameplay experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/0f750dada130e88e67e0528099f5aa3f.poster.avif?t=1787751809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/0f750dada130e88e67e0528099f5aa3f.webm?t=1787751809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/0f750dada130e88e67e0528099f5aa3f.mp4?t=1787751809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dress-Up System</strong>：</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/e972e6cd4ce544e386399ccb0759ca0f.poster.avif?t=1787751809\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/e972e6cd4ce544e386399ccb0759ca0f.webm?t=1787751809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/e972e6cd4ce544e386399ccb0759ca0f.mp4?t=1787751809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4475550/extras/b4efd800279fa419bc21c5b905e05745.poster.avif?t=1787751809\" width=1170 heigh